Has anyone ever had a pet dragon that used its breath weapon
against hostile monsters?  I've had a couple and all they seem
to want to do is attack with claws and teeth.  This would be
an interesting thing to put in the code if not there already.
Of course, it would also be good if the dragon knew not to
breath when you were standing between it and the hostile 
monster. And, come to think of it, bouncing breath weapons
could be dangerous, but, still, it might be interesting.


